{"id":"03675b0df2f4ca9a","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Generic Filter Over Model","display":"df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model — ZFC Forcing Generic Filter Over Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model","58-df-zfc-forcing11-generic-filter-over-model"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model — ZFC Forcing Generic Filter Over Model","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing11-generic-filter-over-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter-over-model — ZFC Forcing Generic Filter Over Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,M,\\mathbb P=(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}),P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(G,M,\\mathbb P=(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}),P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span> (forcing-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span> (transitive ZFC-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11GenericFilterOverModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11GenericFilterOverModel}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}over\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathbb P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;\\bigl((D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}over\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathbb P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;\\bigl((D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\langle d,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}over\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11GenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}over\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11GenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ground-model condition now uses the canonical transitive-model predicate instead of an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Transitive}\">\\(\\operatorname{Transitive}\\)</span> predicate and an untyped <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\">\\(M\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}^{-}\\)</span> clause.</li>\n<li>The poset carrier and order are unpacked from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span>, and density uses membership in that relation rather than treating the relation set as an infix primitive.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S$ (forcing-filter predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S$ (transitive ZFC-model predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,M,\\mathbb P=(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}),P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11GenericFilterOverModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}over\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilterOverModel}_S(G,M,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathbb P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land